{"page":327,"width":1670,"height":2350,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"최대 히프에서 삭제 연산은 최대값을 가진 요소를 삭제하는 것이다. 최대 히프에서 최대값은","words":[{"text":"최대","x":180,"y":192,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"히프에서","x":246,"y":191,"width":106,"height":33},{"text":"삭제","x":367,"y":192,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"연산은","x":433,"y":194,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"최대값을","x":522,"y":195,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"가진","x":637,"y":195,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"요소를","x":699,"y":197,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"삭제하는","x":788,"y":195,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":904,"y":193,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"최대","x":1002,"y":193,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"히프에서","x":1067,"y":192,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"최대값은","x":1186,"y":192,"width":108,"height":32}]},{"text":"루트 노드이뜨로 루트 노드가 삭제된다. 루트 노드 삭제 후에 히프를 재구성하는 것이 필요하게","words":[{"text":"루트","x":149,"y":247,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"노드이뜨로","x":215,"y":245,"width":137,"height":32},{"text":"루트","x":362,"y":247,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"노드가","x":426,"y":248,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"삭제된다.","x":515,"y":248,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"루트","x":639,"y":248,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"노드","x":702,"y":251,"width":53,"height":23},{"text":"삭제","x":765,"y":248,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"후에","x":827,"y":247,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"히프를","x":890,"y":246,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"재구성하는","x":978,"y":245,"width":132,"height":32},{"text":"것이","x":1122,"y":245,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"필요하게","x":1187,"y":244,"width":105,"height":31}]},{"text":"된다. 히프의 재구성이란 히프의 성질을 만족하기 위하여 위, 아래 노드를 교환하는 것이다. [그","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":152,"y":299,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"히프의","x":227,"y":299,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"재구성이란","x":320,"y":299,"width":133,"height":31},{"text":"히프의","x":464,"y":300,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"성질을","x":553,"y":299,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"만족하기","x":641,"y":300,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":"위하여","x":757,"y"